<title>USA: VideoServer Q1 March 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>VideoServer Q1 March 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Mass. 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>VideoServer, Inc.</p>
<p>		    Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>				 (In thousands)</p>
<p>						 For the three months</p>
<p>						    ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997	   1996</p>
<p> Net Sales				   $15,303	$9,510</p>
<p> Cost of Sales				 4,959	 3,073</p>
<p> Gross Profit				 10,344	 6,437</p>
<p>Operating expenses:  </p>
<p>	Research and development	   2,543	 1,583</p>
<p>	Sales and marketing		  2,728	 1,780</p>
<p>	General and administrative	 1,071	   872</p>
<p> Total operating expenses		  6,342	 4,235</p>
<p> Income from operations		    4,002	 2,202</p>
<p> Interest income, net			  525	   408</p>
<p> Income before income taxes		4,527	 2,610</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes		1,630	   705</p>
<p> Net Income				    2,897	 1,905</p>
<p> Net income per share			 0.22	  0.15</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>	shares and equivalents	    13,351	13,122</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
